Krea-2-Turbo MLX engine
=======================

This directory contains a modified derivative of the Krea 2 Turbo model,
redistributed under the Krea 2 Community License Agreement. The full text of
that agreement is in the LICENSE file next to this notice.

Upstream
--------
    krea2_alis_mlx
    https://github.com/avlp12/krea2_alis_mlx

That project is itself an independent, unofficial MLX port of
krea/Krea-2-Turbo and is not an official Krea product.

Modifications
-------------
The MLX Studio project (https://github.com/ours-mlx/mlx-studio) redistributed
this source tree with the following changes:

  * the package was renamed from `krea2/` to `krea2_engine/` so it can coexist
    with the other vendored engines;
  * the Krea-2 model files (transformer, text encoder, sampler) were adapted
    to the engine interfaces of this project;
  * the HF-based text encoder helper `text_encoder_hf.py` was dropped - only
    the pure-MLX text encoder is shipped;
  * the weight cache moved to ~/.cache/krea2_alis_mlx and is fetched from
    Hugging Face at runtime.

This directory contains NO model weights.

Content filtering
-----------------
The Krea 2 Community License requires deployments to implement reasonable
content filtering. The engine ships `safety.py`, an on-by-default pure-MLX
NSFW image classifier, and the studio UI exposes the toggle. It is enabled
by default and can be disabled per call or with KREA2_DISABLE_SAFETY=1.

This is an independent, unofficial port. It is NOT an official Krea product
and is NOT endorsed by or affiliated with Krea.ai, Inc.
